vFM Player - MSX recordings

SD folder: /vFM/recordings/msx

New MSX CAS captures are saved here. Select MSX compatibility and the desired baud rate in Tape Recorder. No download is required.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/recordings/msx

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
